EX0_ISR. . . . . .  C ADDR   0048H   A   
IE . . . . . . . .  D ADDR   00A8H   A   
MAIN . . . . . . .  C ADDR   0030H   A   
MAIN_LOOP. . . . .  C ADDR   003EH   A   
